      "body_html": "Hi Mike. Let me get your opinion. Your description of the plant you said you no longer have fits a description of a freebie I got years ago. It was only described as \"Oreophila tall and vigorous\" Maybe the same plant you had as the photo below?<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2iQu32h\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/49775419346_30580cdb40_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2iQu32h\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">DSCF1762 (1)</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/149474504@N07/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">MICHAEL SPROUSE</a>, on Flickr<br/>",
      "body_text": "Hi Mike. Let me get your opinion. Your description of the plant you said you no longer have fits a description of a freebie I got years ago. It was only described as \"Oreophila tall and vigorous\" Maybe the same plant you had as the photo below?\nDSCF1762 (1)\nby\nMICHAEL SPROUSE\n, on Flickr",
