      "timestamp_epoch_ms": 1586916353000,
      "timestamp_raw": "Apr 14, 2020 21:05:53 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "HI Michael!  Clone#5 looks very different from that one, the neck was much thicker.  It had a unique look to it....you might be better off tracing it back through your source, if you can find out where it originated, then we can make a better educated guess.  Could also be a unique clone that I haven't grown, who knows!",
