      "timestamp_raw": "Apr 27, 2020 15:21:58 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "Two years after repotting, the <i>S. oreophila</i> Mike Wang #4 has completely filled a gallon pot again. The height is best after a few years without disturbance but this plant just fills pots too fast for me.<br/><br/>March 30<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2iKopQ9\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/49717739556_caa6c56e1d_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><br/><br/>April 8<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2iNjsVD\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/49750919007_2a9d2e6151_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><br/><br/>April 27<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2iV2Hry\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/49826866406_960fae6e6b_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><br/><br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2iV2Hts\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/49826866516_97e911bea8_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><br/><br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2iUYYBG\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/49826332118_7190a48aa0_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><br/><br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2iV4k2f\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/49827181212_fc77f538a3_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><br/><br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2iV2Hnf\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/49826866156_7931ef52e6_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><br/><br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2iV4jV3\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/49827180852_313280b4b2_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><br/><br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2iV2HkM\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/49826866071_6f50634944_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a><br/><br/>Besides being a very tall <i>S. oreophila</i>, #4 has a distinct shape - the combination of a tall column, wide and flat lip, and really angular longitudinal veins especially down the back really are an awesome combination.<br/><br/>",
      "body_text": "Two years after repotting, the\nS. oreophila\nMike Wang #4 has completely filled a gallon pot again. The height is best after a few years without disturbance but this plant just fills pots too fast for me.\nMarch 30\nApril 8\nApril 27\nBesides being a very tall\nS. oreophila\n, #4 has a distinct shape - the combination of a tall column, wide and flat lip, and really angular longitudinal veins especially down the back really are an awesome combination.",
